[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to a Denial of Service (DoS) vulnerability. This vulnerability arises from the handling of zip file uploads without adequate validation of the file size or content. If the application allows excessively large zip files or zip files containing a large number of files, it could lead to resource exhaustion on the server, such as memory or CPU overload, when attempting to process these files. This lack of constraints on input size and complexity can be exploited by an attacker to overwhelm the server, rendering the service unavailable to legitimate users.

